  "description": "Wraps DbgEng in a managed Task Asynchronous Pattern (e.g. async/await) so that consumers of this library do not need to be aware of the oddities of the dbgeng threading model. It creates a child process to host the engine out of process (using EngHost.exe) to allow native 32/64 bit debugging of binaries.",
